{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "789e4ddc-d018-8a48-a72b-2b27d315c64b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T15:29:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge R. Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello Owen. My name is Jorge Brito. I need to get a certified copy of a birth certificate. It's for a passport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, certainly. Is that your own birth certificate, Mr. Brito?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, mine. I put the old one up attic years ago and I can't find it anywhere. Been through every box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens. Were you born here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was, yeah. Born right here at the hospital. Sorry, I'm on the bus, so if I [pause] if the line gets bumpy, that's why. It jolts over every bump."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. I can hear you fine so far. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So what ID do I need to bring in? That's my main question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'll want a current photo ID. A driver's license works, or a passport if you have an old one, or a state ID card. Bring the original, not a copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:27:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Driver's license, I got that. It's good until, uh, next year I think. [inaudible] Hold on, we hit another one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I'll wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Sorry about that. Yeah, the license is current."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:28:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That should be fine. Since it's for a passport, tell the person at the counter that, and make sure you ask for a certified copy with the raised seal. A plain photocopy won't be accepted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:28:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Raised seal, got it. Do I need to make an appointment, or can I just walk in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:28:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can walk in during our regular hours. We're open weekdays, and the counter is on the first floor of City Hall. Mornings tend to be a little quieter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:28:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. I'll come in one morning this week then. Is there anything else I should have with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the ID, and your parents' names as they'd appear on the record, in case we need to look it up. The clerk at the counter will go over the form with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Parents' names, okay. I know those. Alright, that's all I needed. Thank you, Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:29:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Brito. Have a safe ride."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T15:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
